        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gĩkuũ kĩa Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thuutha wa ũguo Musa akĩambata kĩrĩma kĩa Nebo oimĩte werũ-inĩ ũrĩa mwaraganu wa Moabi, agĩkinya gacũmbĩrĩ ka Pisiga, kũngʼethera Jeriko. Arĩ hau, Jehova akĩmuonia bũrũri wothe wa Kaanani, kuuma Gileadi nginya Dani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Nafitali guothe, na bũrũri wa Efiraimu na wa Manase, na bũrũri wothe wa Juda wothe nginya iria-inĩ rĩa mwena wa ithũĩro,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na akĩmuonia kũu Negevu na rũgongo ruothe kuuma Gĩtuamba kĩa Jeriko, na Itũũra inene rĩa Mĩkĩndũ, gũthiĩ o nginya Zoari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ningĩ Jehova akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Ũyũ nĩguo bũrũri ũrĩa nderĩire Iburahĩmu, na Isaaka na Jakubu na mwĩhĩtwa rĩrĩa ndoigire atĩrĩ, ‘Nĩngaũhe njiaro cianyu.’ Nĩndareke ũwone na maitho maku, no ndũkũringa ũtoonye kuo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nake Musa, ndungata ya Jehova agĩkuĩra kũu Moabi, o ta ũrĩa Jehova oigĩte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nake akĩmũthika kũu Moabi gĩtuamba kĩrĩa kĩangʼetheire Bethi-Peori, no nginya ũmũthĩ gũtirĩ mũndũ ũũĩ harĩa mbĩrĩra yake ĩrĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa aarĩ na ũkũrũ wa mĩaka igana rĩa mĩrongo ĩĩrĩ agĩkua, na maitho make matiorĩtwo nĩ hinya kana akoorwo nĩ hinya wa mwĩrĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao andũ a Isiraeli magĩcakaĩra Musa kũu werũ-inĩ ũrĩa mwaraganu wa Moabi ihinda rĩa matukũ mĩrongo ĩtatũ, nginya matukũ ma kũmũrĩrĩra na kũmũcakaĩra magĩthira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na rĩrĩ, Joshua mũrũ wa Nuni nĩaiyũrĩtwo nĩ roho wa ũũgĩ, tondũ Musa nĩamũigĩrĩire moko make. Nĩ ũndũ ũcio andũ a Isiraeli makĩmũthikĩrĩria, na magĩĩka ũrĩa Jehova aathĩte Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuuma hĩndĩ ĩyo, gũtirĩ kwagĩa mũnabii ũngĩ ta Musa kũu Isiraeli, ũrĩa Jehova aamenyanĩte nake ũthiũ kwa ũthiũ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ũrĩa waringire ciama na agĩĩka maũndũ ma magegania marĩa Jehova aamũtũmĩte ageeke kũu bũrũri wa Misiri, na kũrĩ Firaũni, na kũrĩ anene ake othe, na kũrĩ bũrũri wake wothe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩgũkorwo gũtirĩ mũndũ ũrĩ wonania hinya mũnene kana ageeka ciĩko cia kũmakania ta iria Musa eekire maitho-inĩ ma andũ a Isiraeli othe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.34.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
